window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Alien ruins—avoid or explore?</b></p> <p>Madison Cardinal knows some mysteries are best left buried—like her past. But there's a new multi-species exploration team in town and their proposed expedition is stirring up trouble.</p> <p>If Madison's new business as a human pilot in Hantu space is to survive, she needs the exploration team to get in, get out, and leave her cargo route intact.</p> <p>So, she agrees to drop them off.</p> <p>But when it's time to collect them, comms are down, the people are missing, and the ruins are… waking up.</p> <p>Alien Haunts <i>is a standalone novel in the Pax Galactica series. It's a character-driven space opera with a twisty plot and a guaranteed happy ever after. </i>Alien Haunts <i>is a novel about finding your place in the universe.</i></p>"; 
